### ============================================================
### USERS — CADASTRO
### Requer TenantAdmin do próprio Tenant
### ============================================================

### Users - Cadastrar usuário no Tenant principal
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário Teste HTTP",
  "email": "usuario-http@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura",
  "role": 4
}


### Users - Tentar cadastrar e-mail duplicado na mesma empresa
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário Duplicado",
  "email": "segundo-usuario-update@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura",
  "role": 4
}


### Users - Cadastrar usuário em Tenant inexistente
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário sem Empresa",
  "email": "sem-empresa@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura",
  "role": 4
}


### Users - Tentar cadastrar SystemAdmin dentro de Tenant
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Administrador do Sistema",
  "email": "system-admin-tenant@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura",
  "role": 1
}


### Users - Cadastrar usuário com senha abaixo do mínimo
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário Senha Curta",
  "email": "senha-curta@test.local",
  "password": "12345678901234",
  "role": 4
}


### Users - Cadastrar usuário em Tenant inativo
### Pré-requisito:
### executar "Tenants - Desativar Tenant principal para testar operações com Tenant inativo"
### em 02-Tenants.http
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário Empresa Inativa",
  "email": "empresa-inativa@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura",
  "role": 4
}


### ============================================================
### USERS — CONSULTA INDIVIDUAL
### Usuários do Tenant podem consultar usuários do próprio Tenant
### ============================================================

### Users - Consultar usuário pelo PublicId
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users/{{usuarioConsultaPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Consultar usuário inexistente
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Consultar usuário em Tenant inexistente
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/users/{{usuarioConsultaPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Tentar consultar usuário através de outro Tenant
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}/users/{{usuarioConsultaPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### USERS — LISTAGEM
### Usuários do Tenant podem listar usuários do próprio Tenant
### ============================================================

### Users - Listar usuários
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários com paginação
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários filtrando por Member
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?role=4
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários filtrando por ProjectManager
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?role=3
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários ativos
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários inativos
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Pesquisar usuário pelo nome
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?search=segundo
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Pesquisar usuário pelo e-mail
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?search=SEGUNDO-USUARIO
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar com número de página inválido
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?pageNumber=0
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar com tamanho de página acima do limite
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar com perfil inválido
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?role=99
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários de Tenant inexistente
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/users
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


