Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Member tentando consultar usuário de outro Tenant - deve retornar 403 Forbidden
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}/users/{{segundoUsuarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Users - Listar usuários sem token - deve retornar 401 Unauthorized
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json


### Users - Member listando usuários do próprio Tenant - deve retornar 200 OK
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


